        }

        RULES {
            #V1Yq08MqXsVX2hUNpPgQvb: kitsune_naturalist_school "Kitsune Naturalist School: Driven from its lands centuries ago, the Fox Clan found refuge in a vast and ancient wooded realm: the Kitsune Forest. The depths of this ancient woodland are rarely seen by humans, and nature spirits flourish here. It is even said that some of these spirits joined the clan, teaching the Kitsune arts for communing with nature spirits unknown to most humans. The shugenja of the Kitsune family learn to be especially attuned to the spirits of animals, plants, and other primordial forces in the world around them. Their tradition leads them to seek a balanced approach to their art, invoking the elements in equal measure rather than creating imbalances in their environment by calling upon any one element too heavily. While many trained in this tradition focus their time on studying how the Mortal Realm and its spiritual inhabitants interact in the Kitsune Forest, others are sent out into Rokugan alongside Kitsune Mediators to help ease tensions between humans and spirits when they occur."
        }
    }

    #eu5phRZ8XCIcNhwI9RdMVn ^"Sand Road Wayfinder Tradition" DEF {
        EXTENDS #L5R252wX4yZ6aB8cD0eF2g ^"School"
