        RULES {
            #bqG2NA7vPzUAbXZhVUudQz: utaku_silent_shadow_yojimbo "Utaku Silent Shadow Yōjimbō: Assimilating back into the Empire—without sacrificing their identity—is perhaps the greatest diplomatic challenge the Unicorn have ever faced. A relatively young school, the Utaku Silent Shadow Yōjimbō School arose from the needs of this challenge, equipping its students not only to protect and advise the clan's diplomats but also to provide such services to those who otherwise cannot attain them. These stoic and calm individuals are known to speak few words, have unyielding convictions, and a lethal fighting prowess. Formed and maintained by the Utaku and Shinjo, this school marries both families' traditions and philosophies, protecting its charges in any terrain, deflecting both blade and damaging word."
        }
    }

