        }

        SCHOOL_ABILITY "Move as the Wind" {
            "When you make a Movement action check or make a check to travel at speed in narrative time, if you succeed, you may suffer up to 2 fatigue to add that many bonus successes. After you remove fatigue at the end of a scene, you may remove additional fatigue up to your school rank."
        }

